36539>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetMinute(dtTime, (Integer(sMinutes)))) to dtTime
36540>>>>>>>        Move (DateSetSecond(dtTime, (Integer(sSeconds)))) to dtTime
36541>>>>>>>        
